g served to a lively dinner table with hands and plates visible — Jonas F on Pexels\" class=\"crop-image h-full w-full object-cover object-[56%_50%]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"menu item image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/26655146/pexels-photo-26655146.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=750&q=80\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <figcaption class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[var(--brass)] pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"item caption container\">\n                            <span class=\"font-display text-2xl leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"item title\">\n                                Pizza & classics\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"item description\">\n                                For the middle\n                            </span>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"food-reveal md:col-span-3 md:mt-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"menu item figure\">\n                        <div class=\"plate-frame crop-hover h-[390px] md:h-[390px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"item image container\" style=\"--frame-cut:var(--stone)\">\n                            <img alt=\"A composed Italian main dish with fresh garnish on a plate — Pinar Kucuk on Unsplash\" class=\"crop-image h-full w-full object-cover object-[52%_52%]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"menu item image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555072930-714bba1d24e2?auto=format&w=850&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <figcaption class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[var(--brass)] pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"item caption container\">\n                            <span class=\"font-display text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"item title\">\n                                Mains\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"item description\">\n                                Take your time\n                            </span>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-10 border-t border-[var(--brass)] pt-7 md:mt-16 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3\" data-name=\"menu section footer\">\n                    <figure class=\"food-reveal md:col-span-3 md:col-start-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"dessert figure\">\n                        <div class=\"plate-frame plate-frame-small crop-hover h-[205px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"dessert image container\" style=\"--frame-cut:var(--stone)\">\n                            <img alt=\"A small final plate set on white ceramic at an Italian table — Chloe Frost-Smith on Unsplash\" class=\"crop-image h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"dessert image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620475676913-9497df261cc3?auto=format&w=700&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <figcaption class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"dessert caption container\">\n                            <span class=\"font-display text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"dessert title\">\n                                Desserts\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"dessert description\">\n                                Leave room\n                            </span>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                    <div class=\"reveal-up md:col-span-6 md:col-start-6 md:pb-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"menu footer text container\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"thread line container\">\n                            <div class=\"thread-line flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"thread line\">\n                            </div>\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-bowl-spoon text-lg text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"utensil icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"menu footer actions\">\n                            <p class=\"max-w-[250px] text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"menu footer info text\">\n                                Lunch, dinner and vegetarian options available.\n                            </p>\n                            <a class=\"text-action text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"view menu link\" href=\"#contact\">\n                                View menu\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-base\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bar-act overflow-hidden bg-[var(--forest)] px-5 py-20 text-[var(--cream)] md:px-8 md:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-3-4