e=\"navigation icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"map-panel reveal-up md:col-span-8 border border-[var(--brass)] p-3 md:p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2\" data-name=\"location map panel\">\n                        <svg aria-label=\"Branded map drawing showing CH House in Jebel Ali, Dubai\" class=\"h-[360px] w-full md:h-[480px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map SVG illustration\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 460\">\n                            <path d=\"M22 322C111 285 131 307 205 262c64-39 86-99 157-82 78 18 91 83 156 62 55-18 69-84 126-110 36-16 66-18 91-14\" stroke=\"var(--espresso)\" stroke-width=\"2.3\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M26 127c62 52 119 9 170 55 59 53 90 105 159 73 71-33 95-12 140 35 55 58 114 56 236-47\" stroke=\"var(--brass)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M160 18c8 75 63 116 91 178 31 70 56 115 121 182M514 12c-28 79-21 135 35 188 57 52 79 107 46 227M347 24c-26 74-2 102 54 146 49 39 42 103 15 174\" stroke=\"var(--brass)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M34 406h694M72 65h644\" stroke=\"rgba(42,28,24,.3)\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                            </path>\n                            <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"231\" r=\"29\" stroke=\"var(--clay)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"231\" fill=\"var(--clay)\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"var(--espresso)\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <path d=\"M420 212c-10-14-25-2-25 10 0 19 25 37 25 37s25-18 25-37c0-12-15-24-25-10Z\" fill=\"var(--clay)\" stroke=\"var(--espresso)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                            </path>\n                            <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"222\" fill=\"var(--cream)\" r=\"4\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <text fill=\"var(--espresso)\" font-family=\"Manrope, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"2\" x=\"458\" y=\"226\">\n                                CH HOUSE\n                            </text>\n                            <text fill=\"var(--espresso)\" font-family=\"Manrope, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" letter-spacing=\"2\" x=\"458\" y=\"246\">\n                                JEBEL ALI · DUBAI\n                            </text>\n                            <text fill=\"var(--ink-soft)\" font-family=\"Manrope, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" letter-spacing=\"2\" x=\"74\" y=\"390\">\n                                THE TABLE IS HERE\n                            </text>\n                        </svg>\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--brass)] pt-3 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"map panel footer\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"map indicator text\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Simplified location drawing\n                            </span>\n                            <a class=\"underline underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"google maps link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=CH+House+Jebel+Ali+Dubai\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Open in Google Maps\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[var(--night)] px-5 pb-8 pt-20 text-[var(--cream)] md:px-8 md:pb-10 md:pt-28\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"site footer\" id=\"contact\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"footer content container\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer header layout\">\n                <h2 class=\"reveal-up font-display text-[clamp(3.3rem,6vw,7rem)] leading-[.87] tracking-[-.025em] md:col-span-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer headline\">\n                    There’s always room\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                    <em data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"headline emphasis\">\n                        for one more.\n                    </em>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"reveal-up text-[12px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--stone)] md:col-span-3 md:col-start-10\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description text\">\n                    An independent Italian bistro, bar & lounge in Dubai.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-16 flex items-center gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"divider thread container\">\n                <div class=\"thread-line flex-1 text-[var(--night)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"thread line\">\n                </div>\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-glass-cocktail text-lg text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cocktail icon\">\n                </i>\n                <div class=\"thread-line w-24 text-[var(--night)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"thread line\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-7 gap-y-10 border-b border-[rgba(168,131,67,.62)] pb-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"footer navigation grid\">\n                <div class=\"col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer brand text\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[.19em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                        CH HOUSE\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[10px] uppercase leading-[1.7] tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--stone)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"brand description\">\n                        Bistro · Bar\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                        Lounge\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\" class=\"col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation menu\">\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#menu\">\n                        Menu\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#about\">\n                        About\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#bar\">\n                        Bar\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#experience\">\n                        Experience\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--brass)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#gallery\">\n                        Gallery\n                    </a>\n                </nav>\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 text-[11px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--stone)] md:col-start-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-3\" data-name=\"footer contact info\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-3 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"contact label\">\n                        Contact\n                    </p>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"phone info\">\n                        [Reservation phone]\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"break-words\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"email info\">\n                        [Reservations email]\n                    </p>\n                    <a class=\"mt-3 inline-block text-[var(--cream)] underline underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-3-4\" data-name=\"instagram link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/chouseuae/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                        Instagram ↗\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 text-[11px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--stone)] md:col-span-3 md:col-start-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4\" data-name=\"footer location info\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-3 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"location label\">\n                        Location\n                    </p>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"address info\">\n                        [Confirmed venue address]\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                        Jebel Ali, Dubai, UAE\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"hours info\">\n                        [Confirmed opening hours]\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 flex items-start justify-start md:col-span-2 md:col-start-11 md:justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-5\" data-name=\"footer action container\">\n                    <a class=\"reserve-button rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--cream)] bg-[var(--cream)] px-5 py-4 text-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[var(--espresso)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"footer reserve button\" href=\"#contact\">\n                        Reserve\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                        a table\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--stone)] sm:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4\" data-name=\"footer metadata\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice\">\n                    © CH House\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2\" data-name=\"legal navigation\">\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"privacy link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Privacy\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"accessibility link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Accessibility\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-3\" data-name=\"location display\">\n                    Dubai, UAE\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <a class=\"mobile-reserve fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-[100] flex h-[52px] items-center justify-center bg-[var(--cream)] text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--espresso)] shadow-[0_-8px_22px_rgba(42,28,24,.14)] lg:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-mobile-reserve=\"\" data-name=\"sticky mobile reserve button\" href=\"#contact\">\n        Reserve a table\n        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ml-2 text-base\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n        </i>\n    </a>\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"lightbox-caption\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"lightbox fixed inset-0 z-[200] min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[var(--night)] px-5 py-20 text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"lightbox overlay\" id=\"lightbox\" role=\"dialog\">\n        <button aria-label=\"Close gallery\" class=\"absolute right-5 top-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-[var(--brass)] text-2xl text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"lightbox close button\" id=\"lightbox-close\" type=\"button\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-x\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"close icon\">\n            </i>\n        </button>\n        <button aria-label=\"Previous image\" class=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 flex h-12 w-12 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center text-2xl text-[var(--cream)] md:left-8\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" data-name=\"lightbox previous image button\" id=\"lightbox-prev\" type=\"button\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-left\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"previous arrow icon\">\n            </i>\n        </button>\n        <figure class=\"flex max-w-[1050px] flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-3\" data-name=\"lightbox image figure\">\n            <img alt=\"A table gathered around shared food and glasses — The Cheeserom on Unsplash\" class=\"lightbox-image w-auto max-w-full object-contain\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1\" data-name=\"lightbox image\" decoding=\"async\" id=\"lightbox-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764236307312-6ead0505ad3a?auto=format&w=1800&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n            <figcaption class=\"mt-6 flex w-full max-w-[860px] items-end justify-between gap-6 border-t border-[rgba(168,131,67,.72)] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"lightbox caption container\">\n                <span class=\"font-display text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-1\" data-name=\"lightbox caption text\" id=\"lightbox-caption\">\n                    A table that expanded.\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"shrink-0 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[var(--stone)]\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-2\" data-name=\"lightbox image counter\" id=\"lightbox-count\">\n                    01 / 05\n                </span>\n            </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <button aria-label=\"Next image\" class=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 flex h-12 w-12 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center text-2xl text-[var(--cream)] md:right-8\" data-kid=\"1-6-4\" data-name=\"lightbox next image button\" id=\"lightbox-next\" type=\"button\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1\" data-name=\"next arrow icon\">\n            </i>\n        </button>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n(function () {\n  const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  const header = document.getElementById('site-header');\n  const hero = document.getElementById('home');\n  const footer = document.getElementById('contact');\n  const mobileReserve = document.querySelector('[data-mobile-reserve]');\n  const menu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');\n  const menuToggle = document.getElementById('menu-toggle');\n  let menuLastFocus = null;\n\n  const updateHeader = () => {\n    if (window.scrollY > Math.max(40, hero.offsetHeight - 88)) header.classList.add('is-scrolled');\n    else header.classList.remove('is-scrolled');\n  };\n  updateHeader();\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', updateHeader, { passive: true });\n\n  if (!reduceMotion) {\n    const heroTimeline = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } });\n    heroTimeline.from('.hero-media', { filter: 'blur(4px)', duration: .72, ease: 'power2.out' })\n      .from('.hero-kicker', { y: 12, opacity: 0, duration: .5 }, '-=.22')\n      .from('.hero-title', { y: 18, opacity: 0, duration: .72 }, '-=.2')\n      .from('.hero-copy', { y: 12, opacity: 0, duration: .5 }, '-=.28')\n      .from('.hero-actions', { y: 12, opacity: 0, duration: .5 }, '-=.28')\n      .from('.hero-rail', { x: 16, opacity: 0, duration: .55 }, '-=.3');\n\n    gsap.to('.hero-media', { yPercent: -2.5, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.hero-section', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: true } });\n    gsap.utils.toArray('.reveal-up').forEach(function (element) {\n      gsap.from(element, { y: 24, opacity: 0, duration: .7, ease: 'power3.out', scrollTrigger: { trigger: element, start: 'top 87%', once: true } });\n    });\n    gsap.utils.toArray('.food-reveal').forEach(function (element, index) {\n      gsap.from(element, { y: index % 2 ? 20 : 34, opacity: 0, duration: .8, delay: index * .04, ease: 'power3.out', scrollTrigger: { trigger: element, start: 'top 90%', once: true } });\n    });\n    gsap.from('.bar-line span', { yPercent: 100, opacity: 0, duration: .65, stagger: .08, ease: 'power3.out', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.bar-heading', start: 'top 82%', once: true } });\n  }\n\n  const setReserveVisibility = () => {\n    if (!mobileReserve) return;\n    const afterHero = window.scrollY > hero.offsetHeight - 70;\n    const footerTop = footer.getBoundingClientRect().top;\n    const footerVisible = footerTop < window.innerHeight - 70;\n    mobileReserve.classList.toggle('is-active', afterHero && !footerVisible);\n  };\n  setReserveVisibility();\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', setReserveVisibility, { passive: true });\n\n  const menuLinks = menu.querySelectorAll('a');\n  const openMenu = () => {\n    menuLastFocus = document.activeElement;\n    menu.classList.add('is-open');\n    menu.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');\n    menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Close menu');\n    header.classList.add('menu-open');\n    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    menuLinks[0].focus();\n  };\n  const closeMenu = () => {\n    menu.classList.remove('is-open');\n    menu.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n    menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    menuToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Open menu');\n    header.classList.remove('menu-open');\n    document.body.style.overflow = '';\n    if (menuLastFocus) menuLastFocus.focus();\n  };\n  menuToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (menu.classList.contains('is-open')) closeMenu(); else openMenu();\n  });\n  menuLinks.forEach(function (link) { link.addEventListener('click', closeMenu); });\n\n  const occasionRows = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.occasion-row'));\n  const occasionPreview = document.getElementById('occasion-preview');\n  const occasionImage = occasionPreview.querySelector('img');\n  const occasionCaption = occasionPreview.querySelector('.occasion-preview-caption');\n  const setOccasion = (row, mobileOpen) => {\n    occasionRows.forEach(function (item) { item.classList.toggle('is-active', item === row); });\n    occasionImage.src = row.dataset.occasionImage;\n    occasionImage.alt = row.dataset.occasionAlt;\n    occasionCaption.textContent = row.dataset.occasionCaption;\n    if (mobileOpen) occasionPreview.classList.add('is-mobile-visible');\n  };\n  setOccasion(occasionRows[0], false);\n  occasionRows.forEach(function (row) {\n    row.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { if (window.innerWidth > 767) setOccasion(row, false); });\n    row.addEventListener('focus', function () { setOccasion(row, window.innerWidth <= 767); });\n    row.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      if (window.innerWidth <= 767 && row.classList.contains('is-active')) occasionPreview.classList.toggle('is-mobile-visible');\n      else setOccasion(row, window.innerWidth <= 767);\n    });\n  });\n\n  const galleryItems = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-lightbox-src]'));\n  const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');\n  const lightboxImage = document.getElementById('lightbox-image');\n  const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightbox-caption');\n  const lightboxCount = document.getElementById('lightbox-count');\n  const closeButton = document.getElementById('lightbox-close');\n  let galleryIndex = 0;\n  let lightboxLastFocus = null;\n  const renderLightbox = (index) => {\n    galleryIndex = (index + galleryItems.length) % galleryItems.length;\n    const item = galleryItems[galleryIndex];\n    lightboxImage.src = item.dataset.lightboxSrc;\n    lightboxImage.alt = item.dataset.lightboxAlt;\n    lightboxCaption.textContent = item.dataset.lightboxCaption;\n    lightboxCount.textContent = String(galleryIndex + 1).padStart(2, '0') + ' / ' + String(galleryItems.length).padStart(2, '0');\n  };\n  const openLightbox = (index) => {\n    lightboxLastFocus = document.activeElement;\n    renderLightbox(index);\n    lightbox.classList.add('is-open');\n    lightbox.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');\n    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    closeButton.focus();\n  };\n  const closeLightbox = () => {\n    lightbox.classList.remove('is-open');\n    lightbox.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n    document.body.style.overflow = '';\n    if (lightboxLastFocus) lightboxLastFocus.focus();\n  };\n  galleryItems.forEach(function (item, index) { item.addEventListener('click', function () { openLightbox(index); }); });\n  document.querySelector('[data-open-first-gallery]').addEventListener('click', function () { openLightbox(0); });\n  closeButton.addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);\n  document.getElementById('lightbox-prev').addEventListener('click', function () { renderLightbox(galleryIndex - 1); });\n  document.getElementById('lightbox-next').addEventListener('click', function () { renderLightbox(galleryIndex + 1); });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {\n    if (event.key === 'Escape') {\n      if (lightbox.classList.contains('is-open')) closeLightbox();\n      else if (menu.classList.contains('is-open')) closeMenu();\n    }\n    if (lightbox.classList.contains('is-open')) {\n      if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') renderLightbox(galleryIndex - 1);\n      if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') renderLightbox(galleryIndex + 1);\n      if (event.key === 'Tab') {\n        const focusables = [closeButton, document.getElementById('lightbox-prev'), document.getElementById('lightbox-next')];\n        const first = focusables[0];\n        const last = focusables[focusables.length - 1];\n        if (event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === first) { event.preventDefault(); last.focus(); }\n        else if (!event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === last) { event.preventDefault(); first.focus(); }\n      }\n    } else if (menu.classList.contains('is-open') && event.key === 'Tab') {\n      const focusables = Array.from(menu.querySelectorAll('a, button'));\n      const first = focusables[0];\n      const last = focusables[focusables.length - 1];\n      if (event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === first) { event.preventDefault(); last.focus(); }\n      else if (!event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === last) { event.preventDefault(); first.focus(); }\n    }\n  });\n}());\n</script>\n",
