ght bitters, Italian wines, classic cocktails and a table worth staying at. CHOUSE moves easily from first drink to final course.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-12 max-w-[590px] border-y border-[var(--mora-candle)]/25\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"bar menu items list\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-sm\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"bar menu item 1\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"item name\">\n                                Aperitivo\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-right text-[var(--mora-candle)]/58\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"item description\">\n                                bitter · citrus · spritz\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 border-t border-[var(--mora-candle)]/25 py-4 text-sm\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"bar menu item 2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"item name\">\n                                Cocktails\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-right text-[var(--mora-candle)]/58\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"item description\">\n                                classics with a CHOUSE pour\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 border-t border-[var(--mora-candle)]/25 py-4 text-sm\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"bar menu item 3\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"item name\">\n                                Wine\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-right text-[var(--mora-candle)]/58\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"item description\">\n                                Italian bottles & easy glasses\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"mora-light-button mt-10 inline-flex items-center border border-[var(--mora-candle)] px-6 py-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[var(--mora-candle)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[var(--mora-candle)] focus-visible:outline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-5\" data-name=\"bar discovery button\" href=\"#contact\">\n                        Discover the bar\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ml-7 text-sm\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"arrow-up-right icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\" class=\"mora-gallery bg-[var(--mora-parchment)] px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-40\" data-kid=\"2-2-5\" data-name=\"gallery section\" id=\"gallery\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1360px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"gallery content container\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-7 border-b border-[var(--mora-espresso)]/28 pb-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"gallery header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"gallery title container\">\n                        <p class=\"mora-kicker mora-reveal text-[var(--mora-clay)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"gallery kicker text\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                            04 / The atmosphere\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mora-serif mora-reveal mt-10 text-[clamp(3.2rem,6.7vw,6.8rem)] leading-[.9] tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"gallery heading\" data-reveal=\"\" id=\"gallery-heading\" style=\"--mora-delay