] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--mora-espresso)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"occasion image caption\" data-reason=\"text updated by interaction\" id=\"occasion-caption\">\n                                Lunch at CHOUSE · easy plates, second espresso\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                        <p class=\"mora-serif mt-7 max-w-[620px] text-3xl leading-[1.05] text-[var(--mora-espresso)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"occasion copy text\" data-reason=\"text updated by interaction\" id=\"occasion-copy\">\n                            A quick plate if you need it; a second espresso if you don’t.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"social-heading\" class=\"bg-[var(--mora-stone)] px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"2-2-7\" data-name=\"social section\" id=\"social\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1360px] gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8\" data-kid=\"2-2-7-1\" data-name=\"social content container\">\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-3 lg:pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"social side header\">\n                    <p class=\"mora-kicker mora-reveal text-[var(--mora-clay)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"social kicker text\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                        06 / Social\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mora-serif mora-reveal mt-12 text-[clamp(3rem,5.6vw,5.4rem)] leading-[.91] tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"social heading\" data-reveal=\"\" id=\"social-heading\" style=\"--mora-delay:100ms\">\n                        From the pass to the last glass.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mora-reveal mt-8 max-w-[260px] text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--mora-espresso)]/70\" data-kid=\"2-2-7-1-1-3\" dat